---
import StudioLayout from '../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import { studioSnapshot as s } from '../../data/studio';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<StudioLayout title="今日作战室 · 原力 Studio">
  <Fragment slot="heading"><h1>今天最重要的，不是多生产，<br/>而是把下一道门推过去。</h1></Fragment>
  <section class="studio-section"><div class="container studio-grid three">
    <article class="studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">本周唯一问题</p><h2>{s.campaign.title}</h2><p>{s.campaign.question}</p><a class="studio-link" href={`${base}/studio/campaigns/${s.campaign.slug}/`}>进入战役作战室 →</a></article>
    <article class="studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">下一道门</p><div class="studio-kpi"><strong>{s.campaign.nextGate}</strong><span>{s.campaign.productionState}</span></div><p>在证据包就绪前，不把Hook升级为事实结论。</p></article>
    <article class="studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">现实验证</p><div class="studio-kpi"><strong>{s.campaign.actionStatus}</strong><span>{s.campaign.actionTarget}</span></div><p>页面与工具存在不等于Used；真实执行仍未建立。</p></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="studio-section"><div class="container"><div class="studio-grid three">
    {['等待裁决','正在推进','等待现实'].map((lane)=><article class="studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">{lane}</p>{s.today.filter(x=>x.lane===lane).map(x=><div><h3>{x.title}</h3><p>{x.source}</p><a class="studio-link" href={x.href}>去真源推进 →</a></div>)}</article>)}
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="studio-section"><div class="container studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">North Star</p><h2>发布不是Done，学习才是复利的开始。</h2><p>{s.northStar}</p></div></section>
</StudioLayout>
